    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32310" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκλαμπ-ρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
